---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Manuel Jiménez"
  description="Professional profile of Manuel Jiménez, a Software Developer with a Higher Technician qualification in Multiplatform Application Development and experience in web development, automation, technology platforms and CMS."
  lang="en"
>
  <article class="about-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">PROFESSIONAL PROFILE</p>

      <p class="profile-name">Manuel Jiménez</p>

      <h1>
        Software Developer with experience in software development, web
        platforms and automation.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        I am Manuel Jiménez, a Software Developer with a Higher Technician
        qualification in Multiplatform Application Development and further
        training in Full Stack Development. My background combines professional
        experience, technical training and academic projects across different
        areas of software development and technology.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <section>
        <h2>Professional Experience &amp; Approach</h2>

        <p>
          My experience combines web platform development and improvement,
          process automation, content management through CMS platforms,
          technical documentation, technology evaluation and support for
          internal systems and platforms.
        </p>

        <p>
          I have worked in both professional and academic environments using
          different technologies and tools, contributing to projects that
          require an understanding of both user needs and the technical context
          in which a solution needs to operate.
        </p>

        <p>
          This experience has helped me develop a practical view of software,
          understanding that a solution depends not only on the technology
          involved, but also on how well it addresses the problem, integrates
          into its environment and can be maintained and evolved.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Academic Education</h2>

        <div class="education-list">
          <article class="education-item">
            <h3>Multiplatform Application Development</h3>
            <p>
              IES Gabriel García Márquez · Higher Technician qualification in
              Multiplatform Application Development (DAM).
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="education-item">
            <h3>Master Full Stack Development</h3>
            <p>MasterD · Specialized non-official training.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Professional Approach</h2>

        <p>
          I am interested in understanding the problem, workflow and
          requirements a solution needs to address before focusing on its
          technical implementation.
        </p>

        <p>
          Throughout my professional experience, I have worked with different
          technologies and tools, researching solutions, resolving issues and
          adapting processes and platforms to the needs of each environment.
        </p>

        <p>
          I also consider continuous learning an important part of software
          development. Technology, tools and technical challenges are constantly
          evolving, which is why I maintain a strong focus on training and
          continued technical development.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Professional Areas of Interest</h2>

        <ul class="interest-list">
          <li>Software Development</li>
          <li>Web Development</li>
          <li>Backend Development</li>
          <li>Full Stack Development</li>
          <li>Process Automation</li>
          <li>IT &amp; Systems</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), var(--content-width));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-block: 4rem 6rem;
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .profile-name {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 750px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .about-content section {
    padding-block: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about-content section:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
  }

  .about-content p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .education-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .education-item {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .education-item h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .interest-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .interest-list li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-block: 3rem 5rem;
    }

    .page-header {
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .about-content section {
      padding-block: 2.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
